    "ornament": "Eight-pointed Oguz Khan star on towers and facades; Turkmen carpet (gul) patterns in paving and building plans; Persian-style domes and Greco-Roman columns on 1990s-2000s buildings; gold-leaf domes and crescents; building shapes echoing function (globe, coin, falcon, wheat ear); embossed Qur'anic epigraphy on mosque walls.",
